{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aLeap Tactics\u300b</strong><br>A pixel-art platform puzzle game where <strong>all mechanisms are controlled by your jumps</strong>. Combine jumping actions with interactive mechanics to cleverly unravel the path to the goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanics</strong><br>Your character has a <strong>unique activation zone</strong>. If this zone overlaps with a mechanism <i>while jumping</i>, the mechanism's state will toggle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/29e07edffd01053b7d3da1c3b88d152b.poster.avif?t=1754575048\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/29e07edffd01053b7d3da1c3b88d152b.webm?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/29e07edffd01053b7d3da1c3b88d152b.mp4?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mechanism Examples</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks that appear/disappear after jumps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/e4938d91ee0dff41979fed4ce8c0af9d.poster.avif?t=1754575048\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/e4938d91ee0dff41979fed4ce8c0af9d.webm?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/e4938d91ee0dff41979fed4ce8c0af9d.mp4?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claws that switch between ascending/descending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/8e34a1c6f0e8e20183be2c3b9e44fc0c.poster.avif?t=1754575048\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/8e34a1c6f0e8e20183be2c3b9e44fc0c.webm?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/8e34a1c6f0e8e20183be2c3b9e44fc0c.mp4?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiked blocks rotating clockwise post-jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/6474a21b9b1d2e765b2139e7c6f882a1.poster.avif?t=1754575048\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/6474a21b9b1d2e765b2139e7c6f882a1.webm?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/6474a21b9b1d2e765b2139e7c6f882a1.mp4?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ladders extending/retracting with jumps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/43e0affa3a328b95b641333e74d944d0.poster.avif?t=1754575048\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/43e0affa3a328b95b641333e74d944d0.webm?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/43e0affa3a328b95b641333e74d944d0.mp4?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A companion that jumps in sync with you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/1a9ad2196e600670dbcb0e087e9645ef.poster.avif?t=1754575048\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/1a9ad2196e600670dbcb0e087e9645ef.webm?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/1a9ad2196e600670dbcb0e087e9645ef.mp4?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Worried about platforming difficulty?</strong><br>Fear not! The game minimizes precise platforming demands. With an undo function, you can undo any jump instantly, focusing purely on puzzle-solving. Accessible even to platforming novices.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/a89a6e3582b5abfd045b13515b06239a.poster.avif?t=1754575048\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/a89a6e3582b5abfd045b13515b06239a.webm?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549150/extras/a89a6e3582b5abfd045b13515b06239a.mp4?t=1754575048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Overview</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ jump-activated mechanisms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80+ handcrafted levels with a gentle difficulty curve</p></li><li><